        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "Here’s a polished and professional version of your email that you can send to the lawyer or property manager:  \n\n---\n\n**Subject:** Clarification Needed Regarding Unidentified Invoice Charge  \n\nDear [Name or Property Management Team],  \n\nI hope this message finds you well.  \n\nI recently received an invoice showing a charge dated **September 15**, but when I spoke with the property management office, they confirmed that the charge did not originate from them. Could you please clarify what this invoice is for?  \n\nAs of yesterday, we confirmed an amount of **$1,531.00**, and I am not sure why this additional charge has appeared. I plan to make the agreed payment from yesterday **today**, but I would appreciate a detailed explanation of this new charge before proceeding further.  \n\nThank you for your assistance and clarification.  \n\nKind regards,  \n**[Your Full Name]**  \n**[Your Unit/Property Address, if applicable]**  \n**[Your Contact Information]**\n\n---\n\nWould you like me to make this version slightly **firmer (more assertive)** or keep it **neutral and polite** like this one?"
          ]
        },
